<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>BPKH Sovereign AI · MONI Platform · Internal AI untuk Insan BPKH</title>
<meta name="description" content="Sovereign AI platform untuk 250+ insan BPKH. 6 role-based dashboard. Zero cloud dependency. ISO 37002 compliant. Pengelolaan dana haji Rp 179+ triliun." />
<meta property="og:title" content="BPKH Sovereign AI · MONI Platform" />
<meta property="og:description" content="Internal AI platform untuk 250+ insan BPKH. Multi-role dashboard, sovereign infrastructure, ISO 37002 compliant." />
<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
<meta property="og:url" content="https://bpkh-moni.mshadianto.my.id" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  :root {
    --navy-900: #0A2540; --navy-800: #103A5C; --navy-700: #1E5A8A;
    --gold-500: #D4AF37; --gold-400: #E5C457; --gold-100: #F4E4BC;
    --cream: #FBF7EE; --ink: #1A1F2E; --ink-soft: #4A5568; --ink-muted: #718096;
    --line: rgba(10, 37, 64, 0.08); --line-strong: rgba(10, 37, 64, 0.18);
    --bg: #F7F5F0; --surface: #FFFFFF; --surface-2: #FAF8F3;
    --green: #16A34A; --green-bg: #DCFCE7; --green-ink: #166534;
    --gold-bg: #FEF7E0;
    --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(10, 37, 64, 0.04);
    --shadow-md: 0 4px 12px rgba(10, 37, 64, 0.06);
    --shadow-lg: 0 10px 30px rgba(10, 37, 64, 0.10);
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 15px; }
  .nav { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--line); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
  .nav-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 14px 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .nav-brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px; color: var(--navy-900); text-decoration: none; }
  .nav-brand-crest { color: var(--gold-500); font-size: 18px; }
  .nav-version { background: var(--gold-bg); color: var(--navy-900); font-size: 9px; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
  .nav-link { color: var(--ink-soft); text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 8px; transition: all 0.15s; font-weight: 500; }
  .nav-link:hover { background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--ink); }
  .nav-cta { background: var(--navy-900); color: var(--gold-100); padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; transition: all 0.15s; }
  .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--navy-800); }

  .hero { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy-900) 0%, var(--navy-800) 60%, #1E3A5C 100%); color: var(--gold-100); padding: 80px 24px 100px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .hero::before { content: ""; position: absolute; right: -200px; top: -200px; width: 600px; height: 600px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%); pointer-events: none; }
  .hero::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: -150px; bottom: -150px; width: 400px; height: 400px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(30, 90, 138, 0.4) 0%, transparent 70%); pointer-events: none; }
  .hero-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .hero-crest { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: var(--gold-500); margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 500; }
  .hero h1 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.025em; margin: 0 0 18px; color: var(--gold-100); line-height: 1.1; }
  .hero-sub { font-size: clamp(15px, 1.6vw, 18px); color: rgba(244, 228, 188, 0.78); margin: 0 0 36px; max-width: 720px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .hero-cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-hero-primary { background: var(--gold-500); color: var(--navy-900); padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; transition: all 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.35); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .btn-hero-primary:hover { background: var(--gold-400); transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.45); }
  .btn-hero-secondary { background: rgba(244, 228, 188, 0.1); color: var(--gold-100); padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; border: 0.5px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3); transition: all 0.2s; }
  .btn-hero-secondary:hover { background: rgba(244, 228, 188, 0.18); }
  .hero-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 60px; padding-top: 36px; border-top: 0.5px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2); }
  .hero-stat-num { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--gold-100); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .hero-stat-label { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(244, 228, 188, 0.6); margin-top: 4px; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }

  .section { padding: 80px 24px; }
  .section-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .section-eyebrow { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.25em; color: var(--gold-500); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight: 500; }
  .section-title { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 40px); font-weight: 500; margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--navy-900); letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.15; }
  .section-sub { font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 680px; margin: 0 0 48px; line-height: 1.7; }

  .demo-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; margin-top: 36px; }
  .demo-card { background: var(--surface); border: 0.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; padding: 32px; transition: all 0.2s; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .demo-card.featured { border: 1px solid var(--gold-500); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
  .demo-card.featured::before { content: "RECOMMENDED"; position: absolute; top: 16px; right: 16px; background: var(--gold-500); color: var(--navy-900); font-size: 9px; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
  .demo-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
  .demo-version { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--gold-500); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .demo-title { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .demo-tagline { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0 0 20px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .demo-features { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 24px; }
  .demo-features li { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-soft); padding: 5px 0; padding-left: 22px; position: relative; line-height: 1.5; }
  .demo-features li::before { content: "▸"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--gold-500); font-weight: 700; }
  .demo-cta { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  .btn-demo-primary { background: var(--navy-900); color: var(--gold-100); padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; flex: 1; text-align: center; transition: all 0.15s; }
  .btn-demo-primary:hover { background: var(--navy-800); }
  .btn-demo-secondary { background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--ink-soft); padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.15s; border: 0.5px solid var(--line); }
  .btn-demo-secondary:hover { background: var(--gold-bg); color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--gold-500); }

  .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
  .feature { background: var(--surface); border: 0.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .feature:hover { border-color: var(--gold-500); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .feature-icon { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--gold-bg); color: var(--navy-900); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 18px; font-weight: 500; }
  .feature h3 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .feature p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0; line-height: 1.65; }

  .roles-section { background: var(--surface); padding: 80px 24px; border-top: 0.5px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--line); }
  .roles-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 14px; margin-top: 36px; }
  .role-card { padding: 22px; border-radius: 14px; border: 0.5px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface-2); }
  .role-tag { display: inline-block; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--navy-900); color: var(--gold-100); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .role-card h3 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0 0 4px; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .role-org { font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-muted); margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
  .role-features { font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.6; }

  .architecture { padding: 80px 24px; }
  .arch-diagram { background: var(--navy-900); color: var(--gold-100); padding: 40px; border-radius: 20px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.9; overflow-x: auto; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
  .arch-comment { color: rgba(244, 228, 188, 0.5); }
  .arch-keyword { color: var(--gold-500); font-weight: 500; }

  .compliance { background: var(--cream); padding: 80px 24px; }
  .compliance-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 36px; }
  .compliance-item { background: var(--surface); padding: 24px; border-radius: 14px; border: 0.5px solid var(--line); text-align: center; }
  .compliance-badge { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--gold-500); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .compliance-name { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--navy-900); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .compliance-desc { font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-muted); line-height: 1.5; }

  .cta-section { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy-900) 0%, var(--navy-800) 100%); padding: 80px 24px; color: var(--gold-100); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .cta-section::before { content: ""; position: absolute; right: -100px; bottom: -100px; width: 400px; height: 400px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%); pointer-events: none; }
  .cta-inner { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .cta-section h2 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 40px); font-weight: 500; margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--gold-100); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .cta-section p { font-size: 16px; color: rgba(244, 228, 188, 0.78); margin: 0 0 32px; line-height: 1.7; }

  .footer { background: var(--navy-900); color: rgba(244, 228, 188, 0.6); padding: 40px 24px 24px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; border-top: 0.5px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15); }
  .footer-crest { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; color: var(--gold-500); letter-spacing: 0.15em; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 13px; }
  .footer a { color: var(--gold-400); text-decoration: none; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero { padding: 50px 20px 60px; }
    .section, .roles-section, .architecture, .compliance, .cta-section { padding: 50px 20px; }
    .hero-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 36px; padding-top: 24px; }
    .features, .roles-grid, .compliance-grid, .demo-options { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .arch-diagram { padding: 20px; font-size: 11px; }
    .nav-links { gap: 4px; }
    .nav-link { padding: 6px 8px; font-size: 11px; }
    .nav-cta { padding: 6px 10px; font-size: 11px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="/" class="nav-brand">
      <span class="nav-brand-crest">⚜</span>
      <span>BPKH MONI</span>
      <span class="nav-version">v3.1</span>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#try" class="nav-link">Try Demo</a>
      <a href="#roles" class="nav-link">For Roles</a>
      <a href="#architecture" class="nav-link">Architecture</a>
      <a href="/platform.html" class="nav-cta">Launch Platform →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-crest">⚜ BPKH SOVEREIGN AI · INTERNAL PLATFORM ⚜</div>
    <h1>AI Platform untuk 250+ Insan BPKH</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Internal sovereign AI platform untuk seluruh insan BPKH — Komite Audit, Dewan Pengawas, Auditor, Investasi, Hukum, dan Pegawai. Role-based dashboard, zero cloud dependency, ISO 37002 compliant. Dibangun untuk pengelolaan dana haji Rp 179+ triliun.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="/platform.html" class="btn-hero-primary">⚡ Launch Platform v3.1</a>
      <a href="#try" class="btn-hero-secondary">View All Demos</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div><div class="hero-stat-num">250+</div><div class="hero-stat-label">INSAN BPKH</div></div>
      <div><div class="hero-stat-num">6</div><div class="hero-stat-label">USER ROLES</div></div>
      <div><div class="hero-stat-num">100%</div><div class="hero-stat-label">SOVEREIGN</div></div>
      <div><div class="hero-stat-num">220</div><div class="hero-stat-label">REGULASI</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="try" class="section">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">⎯ Try It Live</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Pilih demo yang sesuai dengan kebutuhan Anda</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Dua versi tersedia. Platform v3 untuk experience lengkap multi-role enterprise. Simple demo untuk fokus pada DALIL search + DAWWIN C4R.</p>
    <div class="demo-options">
      <div class="demo-card featured">
        <div class="demo-version">v3.0 · ENTERPRISE</div>
        <h3 class="demo-title">MONI Platform — Multi-role</h3>
        <p class="demo-tagline">Comprehensive enterprise platform untuk seluruh insan BPKH. Role-based dashboard dengan 6 role berbeda, sidebar navigation app-style, personal workspace, risk register, compliance check, knowledge base, dan more.</p>
        <ul class="demo-features">
          <li>6 user roles dengan dashboard berbeda</li>
          <li>Personal workspace (saved searches, drafts)</li>
          <li>Risk register dengan severity tracking</li>
          <li>Compliance check pre-execution validator</li>
          <li>Knowledge base + FAQ untuk insan BPKH</li>
          <li>Activity tracking dan notifications</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="demo-cta">
          <a href="/platform.html" class="btn-demo-primary">⚡ Launch Platform v3</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="demo-card">
        <div class="demo-version">v2.0 · CLASSIC</div>
        <h3 class="demo-title">MONI Standalone Demo</h3>
        <p class="demo-tagline">Versi sederhana single-page untuk fokus demo DALIL search + DAWWIN C4R generator. Cepat, focused, mobile-friendly. Ideal untuk quick exploration tanpa role complexity.</p>
        <ul class="demo-features">
          <li>DALIL search 220 regulasi BPKH</li>
          <li>DAWWIN C4R workpaper generator</li>
          <li>Sovereignty score &amp; audit log</li>
          <li>KB catalog dengan charts</li>
          <li>Infrastructure overview</li>
          <li>Print &amp; export functionality</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="demo-cta">
          <a href="/simple-demo.html" class="btn-demo-primary">▸ Open Simple Demo</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="roles" class="roles-section">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">⎯ Built for Every Role</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Satu platform, enam pengalaman berbeda</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Setiap role di BPKH dapat dashboard, navigation, dan tools yang disesuaikan dengan kebutuhan kerja mereka. Struktur sesuai <strong>UU 34/2014</strong>: <em>two-board system</em> Dewan Pengawas + Badan Pelaksana, plus Komite Audit sebagai support body. Login dengan email <code style="background: var(--surface-2); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px;">@bpkh.go.id</code> auto-detect role.</p>
    <div class="roles-grid">
      <div class="role-card">
        <span class="role-tag">DEWAN PENGAWAS</span>
        <h3>Anggota Dewan Pengawas</h3>
        <p class="role-org">7 anggota · Organ Pengawas BPKH</p>
        <p class="role-features">Executive dashboard, sovereignty report, risk overview, monthly compliance summary untuk pengawasan kebijakan & kinerja Badan Pelaksana</p>
      </div>
      <div class="role-card">
        <span class="role-tag">KOMITE AUDIT</span>
        <h3>Anggota Komite Audit</h3>
        <p class="role-org">~5 anggota · Support body Dewas</p>
        <p class="role-features">DALIL search, DAWWIN C4R generator, audit log review, sovereignty monitoring, findings tracker</p>
      </div>
      <div class="role-card">
        <span class="role-tag">BADAN PELAKSANA</span>
        <h3>Anggota Badan Pelaksana</h3>
        <p class="role-org">7 anggota · Organ Eksekutif BPKH</p>
        <p class="role-features">Decision dashboard, approval workflow, investment tracker, operational KPI untuk eksekusi kebijakan strategis BPKH</p>
      </div>
      <div class="role-card">
        <span class="role-tag">KEDEPUTIAN</span>
        <h3>Pegawai Kedeputian</h3>
        <p class="role-org">Investasi · Operasional · Keuangan</p>
        <p class="role-features">Compliance pre-execution check, threshold validator, approval workflow, regulasi reference untuk operasional sehari-hari</p>
      </div>
      <div class="role-card">
        <span class="role-tag">SPI · INTERNAL AUDIT</span>
        <h3>Auditor Internal (SPI)</h3>
        <p class="role-org">~30 user · Satuan Pengawasan Internal</p>
        <p class="role-features">Risk register, finding tracker, working paper management, remediation tracking, DAWWIN C4R</p>
      </div>
      <div class="role-card">
        <span class="role-tag">INSAN BPKH</span>
        <h3>Insan BPKH (general)</h3>
        <p class="role-org">~190 user · Pegawai BPKH</p>
        <p class="role-features">Search 220 regulasi BPKH, knowledge base, FAQ, personal workspace, notifications regulasi update</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">⎯ Mengapa Sovereign</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">AI yang tidak pernah keluar dari rumah Anda</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Setiap kalimat dari regulasi BPKH, setiap workpaper audit, setiap whistleblowing report — diproses 100% di infrastruktur on-premise. Tidak ada API call ke OpenAI, Anthropic, atau cloud manapun.</p>
    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="feature-icon">⚜</div>
        <h3>Data Sovereignty</h3>
        <p>Semua inference berjalan di Ollama lokal dengan model llama3.1:8b. Zero data exfiltration. Audit trail dengan SHA-256 chain memberikan cryptographic proof.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="feature-icon">⊕</div>
        <h3>Modular Architecture</h3>
        <p>Setiap modul (DALIL, DAWWIN, WBS, Audit) berjalan sebagai MCP server independen. Frontend split dari backend, easy plug-in ke existing BPKH systems.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="feature-icon">∞</div>
        <h3>Sensitivity-Aware Routing</h3>
        <p>Gateway router memilah request berdasarkan sensitivity: public/internal/confidential/restricted. WBS reports FORCED ke local untuk perlindungan maksimal.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="feature-icon">◇</div>
        <h3>ISO 37002 Compliant</h3>
        <p>Whistleblowing system mengikuti standar ISO 37002:2021. PII redaction otomatis, audit trail immutable, schema-per-service di Postgres.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="feature-icon">♦</div>
        <h3>Sharia-Aligned</h3>
        <p>Knowledge base 220 regulasi BPKH (PBPKH, PKBP, SOP) ter-vectorize ke Qdrant. Semantic search untuk regulatori syariah dengan 96% akurasi pada test corpus.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
        <h3>Production-Ready</h3>
        <p>Docker Compose deployment, schema migration otomatis, health checks built-in. SumoPod VPS proven dengan BAYAN AI live di bayan.bpkhlimited.com.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="architecture" class="architecture">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">⎯ Architecture</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">9 services, 1 sovereign network</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Stack production yang sudah running di SumoPod VPS. Semua service berkomunikasi melalui internal network, hanya Adapter Gateway yang exposed ke public dengan SSL.</p>
